(a) linearized GR scalar sector gauge invariant (eps and chi): True
(b) Wess-Zumino consistency [d2 A1 - d1 A2 = total derivative]: True
(c) WZ coefficient solutions: [{c1: 1, c2: -1, c3: 1, c4: -1/2, c5: 0, c6: 0, c7: 0, c8: 0, c9: 0}]
    minimal WZ term (free coefficients set to 0, they are separately gauge invariant):
    L_WZ = a*(2*Derivative(B(t, x, y, z), x)*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), x) + 2*Derivative(B(t, x, y, z), y)*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), y) + 2*Derivative(B(t, x, y, z), z)*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), z) - 2*Derivative(Phi(t, x, y, z), x)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), x) - 2*Derivative(Phi(t, x, y, z), y)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), y) - 2*Derivative(Phi(t, x, y, z), z)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), z) - Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), x)**2 + 2*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), x)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), t, x) - Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), y)**2 + 2*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), y)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), t, y) - Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), z)**2 + 2*Derivative(pi(t, x, y, z), z)*Derivative(zeta(t, x, y, z), t, z))/2
    check delta(L_WZ) + delta(anomaly) = total derivative: True

